THE LANGUAGES

Hao-shuo-de and Jiandanhua are languages. A language as such (its grammar and
vocabulary as a system) is free: anyone may learn it, speak it, write in it,
translate into it and teach it, and may create their own original texts in
it. This freedom covers the languages only, not the materials in this
repository and not the names. A formal open licence for a specification of
the languages may be published separately; until then, nothing here grants
one.

